# Managed by the workflow pipeline. Written on first run if absent, and never
# overwritten afterwards — edit freely.
#
# These rules live here rather than in the repository's root .gitignore for
# three reasons: this file is owned by the pipeline, so nothing has to merge
# into a file you own; it is committed, so everyone who clones inherits the
# rules instead of each person wiring them at install time; and the paths are
# relative to this directory, so they stay correct if the tree ever moves.

# Machine-local: holds an absolute path to your knowledge vault, which is
# meaningless — and mildly disclosing — on anyone else's machine.
config.json

# Derived projections of per-item frontmatter, rebuilt on demand by
# bin/workflow-index. Committing them is what produces the merge conflicts
# this design exists to avoid: every branch regenerates the whole table, so
# two branches touching any item conflict across the entire file.
thoughts/_MAP.md
thoughts/_DEPS.md
backlog/_DEPS.md
